      <section class="section-faq">
        <div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container-1280 w-container">
          <div class="faq-wrapper">
            <div class="left_side-faq">
              <div class="header-faq">
                <div class="text_heading-faq">
                  <div class="text-12-caps opacity-60 center-small">Frequently asked questions</div>
                  <div class="max-w-400">
                    <h2 class="h2 center-small"><span class="span">Got questions?<br>‍</span>We&#x27;ve got answers</h2>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80 center-small">We want to make sure you feel confident that our service is right for you. Here we’ve looked to address some commonly asked questions. If you have any more specific questions, don’t hesitate to get in touch with a member of the team.</p>
              </div><img loading="lazy" src="/images/Frame-1707478606_4.avif" alt="An abstract digital interface featuring a dark theme with various input fields, a progress bar, and a question mark icon, suggesting a user-friendly design for a software application." class="image-faq">
            </div>
            <div class="right_side-faq">
              <div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="39b3f493-d30d-692e-fefa-e5235c477dbb" class="dropdown-faq w-dropdown">
                <div class="dropdown-top w-dropdown-toggle">
                  <p class="text-14-150">Which model is right for us?</p>
                  <div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="ic-plus-faq" data-w-id="39b3f493-d30d-692e-fefa-e5235c477dbf" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/62581cacf7654a9838775673/62581cacf7654a49f0775692_plus.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div>
                </div>
                <nav style="height:0px" class="dropdown-list-faq w-dropdown-list">
                  <div class="wrapper-text-faq">
                    <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80">One video or a handful a year, fixed price is better value. Video every month, a subscription costs less past roughly four videos a year. Credits sit between the two. Send us a brief and we will tell you which fits, including when the answer is the cheaper one.</p>
                  </div>
                </nav>
              </div>
              <div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="39b3f493-d30d-692e-fefa-e5235c477dd3" class="dropdown-faq w-dropdown">
                <div class="dropdown-top w-dropdown-toggle">
                  <p class="text-14-150">What does each model include?</p>
                  <div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="ic-plus-faq" data-w-id="39b3f493-d30d-692e-fefa-e5235c477dd7" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/62581cacf7654a9838775673/62581cacf7654a49f0775692_plus.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div>
                </div>
                <nav style="height:0px" class="dropdown-list-faq w-dropdown-list">
                  <div class="wrapper-text-faq">
                    <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80">The full process, from planning and storyboarding through to final delivery in the formats you need. Fixed price scopes that to one project. Subscription gives you a named team every month. Credits give you a prepaid balance to spend as work comes up.</p>
                  </div>
                </nav>
              </div>
              <div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="39b3f493-d30d-692e-fefa-e5235c477de0" class="dropdown-faq w-dropdown">
                <div class="dropdown-top w-dropdown-toggle">
                  <p class="text-14-150">Can we switch models later?</p>
                  <div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="ic-plus-faq" data-w-id="39b3f493-d30d-692e-fefa-e5235c477de4" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/62581cacf7654a9838775673/62581cacf7654a49f0775692_plus.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div>
                </div>
                <nav style="height:0px" class="dropdown-list-faq w-dropdown-list">
                  <div class="wrapper-text-faq">
                    <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80">Yes. Most clients start with one project and move to a subscription once they need output monthly. We work out the details with you on a call.</p>
                  </div>
                </nav>
              </div>
              <div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="39b3f493-d30d-692e-fefa-e5235c477de9" class="dropdown-faq w-dropdown">
                <div class="dropdown-top w-dropdown-toggle">
                  <p class="text-14-150">What drives the price?</p>
                  <div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="ic-plus-faq" data-w-id="39b3f493-d30d-692e-fefa-e5235c477ded" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/62581cacf7654a9838775673/62581cacf7654a49f0775692_plus.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div>
                </div>
                <nav style="height:0px" class="dropdown-list-faq w-dropdown-list">
                  <div class="wrapper-text-faq">
                    <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80">Length, animation style and how much is built from scratch. A 60 second 2D explainer using your brand assets sits at the lower end. 3D, custom illustration and sound design move it up.</p>
                  </div>
                </nav>
              </div>
              <div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="08cd041f-b5e3-4810-0514-cd48eea3119c" class="dropdown-faq w-dropdown">
                <div class="dropdown-top w-dropdown-toggle">
                  <p class="text-14-150">How fast is delivery?</p>
                  <div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="ic-plus-faq" data-w-id="08cd041f-b5e3-4810-0514-cd48eea311a0" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/62581cacf7654a9838775673/62581cacf7654a49f0775692_plus.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div>
                </div>
                <nav style="height:0px" class="dropdown-list-faq w-dropdown-list">
                  <div class="wrapper-text-faq">
                    <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80">Six working days for a 60 second video, eight for 90 seconds. Faster is available at additional cost when a launch date will not move.</p>
                  </div>
                </nav>
              </div>
              <div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="76692f1a-dc9e-b8c3-c620-cf52812c2750" class="dropdown-faq w-dropdown">
                <div class="dropdown-top w-dropdown-toggle">
                  <p class="text-14-150">What are the payment terms?</p>
                  <div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="ic-plus-faq" data-w-id="76692f1a-dc9e-b8c3-c620-cf52812c2754" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/62581cacf7654a9838775673/62581cacf7654a49f0775692_plus.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div>
                </div>
                <nav style="height:0px" class="dropdown-list-faq w-dropdown-list">
                  <div class="wrapper-text-faq">
                    <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80">Everything upfront. Fixed price and credits are invoiced before work starts. Subscriptions run on the calendar month.</p>
                  </div>
                </nav>
              </div>
              <div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="8e592a4c-d1f6-f566-098f-c44647e61268" class="dropdown-faq w-dropdown">
                <div class="dropdown-top w-dropdown-toggle">
                  <p class="text-14-150">Who owns the finished work?</p>
                  <div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="ic-plus-faq" data-w-id="8e592a4c-d1f6-f566-098f-c44647e6126c" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/62581cacf7654a9838775673/62581cacf7654a49f0775692_plus.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div>
                </div>
                <nav style="height:0px" class="dropdown-list-faq w-dropdown-list">
                  <div class="wrapper-text-faq">
                    <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80">You do. Full commercial rights and source files on everything we deliver.</p>
                  </div>
                </nav>
              </div>
              <div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="a169f4aa-b6ab-c409-51d5-4ce5863d8830" class="dropdown-faq w-dropdown">
                <div class="dropdown-top w-dropdown-toggle">
                  <p class="text-14-150">Is the free sample really free?</p>
                  <div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="ic-plus-faq" data-w-id="a169f4aa-b6ab-c409-51d5-4ce5863d8834" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/62581cacf7654a9838775673/62581cacf7654a49f0775692_plus.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div>
                </div>
                <nav style="height:0px" class="dropdown-list-faq w-dropdown-list">
                  <div class="wrapper-text-faq">
                    <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80">Yes. Real work on your own brand in 3 working days, no card and nothing to sign. If it is not right, you have lost nothing.</p>
                  </div>
                </nav>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
